{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:885e4d33b7571928c9a1ed02f335e3f1095352eeaeaf65f1df6d8dfd7105e565",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01d1ddcf223754d719385c0e6ab1ff7da98be468b08dce4ff7899b38690f442a",
      "text": "我行我素的穿搭",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:404401f01cd2bd5e255f8de6bea9af517f340bbf76eab41ce4cc4cb4862df03c",
      "text": "圭决定在脱口秀节目中展示自己的私服，\n于是找制作人商量。\n当制作人询问他平时是怎么选衣服的时，\n圭回答说是醒来看到什么就穿什么……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01d1ddcf223754d719385c0e6ab1ff7da98be468b08dce4ff7899b38690f442a",
      "text": "我行我素的穿搭",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_a:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38b60be950a30739b8e465ec6b48532a2d82dd9365a9250d6c825bb3779f6b16",
      "text": "嗯——该怎么办好呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_a:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80f5e38c7df5eaddaf7be56806e7b1bb314157a34d29dddb45f4b312386c5915",
      "text": "圭先生？怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c75f60199eef14befcab5830bc1e8ca04f53adf976ecd9f60f36f8ad4841f48",
      "text": "啊，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63eb97a71efc660d1ccea003a34264f715124ce98015a1fde750d298e9b97fcf",
      "text": "下次的脱口秀节目不是要展示我的私服吗？\n我正在想带什么过去好呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6acdc86c38abe4709db47925e5129f84dc111ec6e3fed6ea23a0aee5122b8407",
      "text": "平时都是怎么挑选的呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f006df3df30d5675fe5c74aa34391b224d4380812bbd435e0130544cb59955a",
      "text": "醒来后映入眼帘的衣服呀。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e15770043442fb3e48c733388b0b3c5e64139782f484f90c4cfe244b4ab9197",
      "text": "原来如此。\n没有什么“唯独这点绝不妥协”的原则吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47dcbdfa705c071d43c0c80cdd6653a32802a47acef9cf172acb90514280d1ed",
      "text": "唔，衣长合不合适？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36f93fd5ea23f520c580a6e46cb30e04eed76fd45cc53620365e376ba74a0314",
      "text": "……对了，我想到一个好主意。\n那个，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_a:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:904751f26d3610aa0bdf4b649018a9e9b26f3e123bffee46008d3e7c50f8e265",
      "text": "能不能像制作我那样，\n和我一起挑衣服呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95f32c11bd317b4af0010fc446b501143717ff41c7122be731b87a4119a5ca8b",
      "text": "我请你来家里。虽然说是\n朋友夫妇的家就是了。什么时候能来呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_b:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f544a5b874e07641873b6e82f776f76e4c57cd9e7d3aeac23e601045da978837",
      "text": "圭的朋友家中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_b:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29048b594438b566e32ef886267087b635b138c8d30f930b7c1d86b945a87097",
      "text": "欢迎，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_b:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23255cd301e3d59c0c403f7b62b44b33d84fa6b8b66e1b0929f81a1cca950e52",
      "text": "打扰了。真是个很棒的房子呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58048a95c06de5ce73a63593b30ad4670c8d38ae05e53ad36de87223658b127f",
      "text": "呵呵，谢谢。\n我会转告今天不在家的朋友们的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1712df5e7a56414d35fbcd3619324bab43fb9ba55f912c75a8a7bc8b458985f9",
      "text": "我把我有的衣服全都拿出来了哦。\n这样可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7e8266a78304c6acc523897738228ba5aeafedf9dbc31f8042cd8b7897ef1e8",
      "text": "谢谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:487d0fe10ee16cb08720d580364adfe9f709e666bc0806d0372e620bb917c1da",
      "text": "原来我有这么多衣服啊。\n以前都没在意过呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77ca014c6499b30ea173e1d5818e5902df54fdd02e9ecdf6182cb861b0dd06bd",
      "text": "您自己平时不买衣服吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f13df2121f5c430e5e7b69b9652340c5616b5ee5a42f081b48cfbcd71fe0e0e1",
      "text": "嗯，这里的衣服全都是别人送的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0dac5ef129aea8cd4dff86107be7db1ce8d0723182132fb0f4fbb151ce9312e0",
      "text": "说是穿这个暖和、衣长正合适之类的，\n各种各样的人送给我的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_c:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f03756e983e8457c53ca73e7e19d774b7bbff9022fb59edf55b4f0da54a13ea2",
      "text": "……这是女款上衣？\n圭先生，混进了您朋友夫妇的衣服哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0a475a0aa439c3da7e58329b6d681ea9bd8825daefae8548ec5f45993ce7003",
      "text": "嗯，哪件？……啊。那件也是我的衣服哦。\n我记得曾经穿去过事务所……大概吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:939a8300657280b8076417445881a623f96f59e8033cbce154c7787129c9b3c6",
      "text": "这样看虽然能看出是女装，\n但圭先生穿的时候完全没注意到呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_c:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5bb1b21bb00f9ea5739ea4337138e4111cbfaea2e5db6dfef9838a3c9a06049",
      "text": "我行我素，只要衣长合适\n什么都能穿得自然得体……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:743a046eff8ee9980b31fb98d87165fbd405fdcb7d965f40b658f192a6ce0bdf",
      "text": "下次的节目，就将这一点\n作为圭先生的魅力传达出去吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:504e97f9ee4ce07cd1445e29ad8c0580f3789136bc897714910b611c49aa8800",
      "text": "既然你这么说，那一定就是这样最好了。\n就像一直以来那样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ac20cf05858ab5d3120b17a534b9083916854d54fc9faa73fafd21bc1e83205",
      "text": "那么，首先就按照平时的习惯，\n自然地挑挑看衣服吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7de8f5a994989a7f004655fa218278afa41de82ac208a18f1f420a3c794b3594",
      "text": "嗯，知道了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f86f92afee3a05a97784ce9039f83c7974f3cf3f1fc79d1aaf79c0ed7f9a8ba1",
      "text": "谢谢你，●●●●プロデューサー。\n该怎么做，答案原来这么简单啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_d:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:201540db55ff638bdc819fd57afc446122e0486c3f490145e81a42dbe00ea492",
      "text": "说起来……\n你一直拿着那件衣服呢。很中意吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_d:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0fe46ddd2067e49322906c3658ed16475ffd229dde46eee10cf43f1a99af934",
      "text": "是的，非常中意！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_d:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01f98e1941647f54ded071a0ac44a3ad79de761974b5e27b0c0957f401e9d531",
      "text": "这样啊。试着穿穿看吧。要是尺寸合适就送你啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_d:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce35e7faa4377353aedddc7ebeb7e3ef9e9ed21a75805d8199f0e1770267334e",
      "text": "不、不是的，我不是这个意思。我只是在想，\n把这件用在穿搭里怎么样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f42dd7c3a0de6f26959efc4b0dc8471f1d33d16b5c420adca78d7dd82009f97f",
      "text": "啊，原来是这样啊。\n那就用它试试看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_d:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14375eba7ab9a833ac3db486d02a3a511b06b3e3ecf11fd6775b5aa517a93028",
      "text": "……早上醒来时，如果有●●●●プロデューサー\n在身边，大概就是这种感觉吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_d:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40c510a8da6d9ffb19f7c2e00c9f448a0e13fd4c62a262308655235148f7df6f",
      "text": "挑衣服变得又开心又轻松。\n稍微想象一下……早上好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_d:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22116f19921c90f4733163d85692ae11ccd5d703f0dd0f500fe2e9ddef5b4ca4",
      "text": "（圭先生正在从早晨醒来开始做模拟啊。\n既然这样……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_d:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b167f03a602459da66841c869594c5ca7b596c3f0003cb14ccaf30e620b229d",
      "text": "早上好，圭先生！\n我们赶紧来决定今天要穿的衣服吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_d:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9810ceebe4678c82b38960745ccda51df2d2e5a9a09ffeeb13f7288379746f58",
      "text": "好啊。今天就穿这件和这件吧。\n然后再搭上你帮我选的这件衣服……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_d:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc1ebaad3e78b110f4d5d041813f8b005b6261995d6f98fa07b3385fe2d5f7b9",
      "text": "（太好了。这样看来，节目用的穿搭\n能顺利决定下来了！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_e:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2a40248a047b34eca4002dcdf855823097e67ae97e2d83de4a83373b48f972a",
      "text": "几周后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_e:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d44ac72f43783e93059aa23ae50712d9a680fe972f038d5556f66d843464f0b",
      "text": "辛苦了，●●●●プロデューサー。\n找我谈话，是什么事呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_e:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22860cd1ac7ab1307f54666acc8f50d37a0da3d40a0106063be9a736906d0912",
      "text": "其实，前阵子的节目组那边\n发来了新的工作邀约！据说是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_e:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c14b8e849a69aa30d3241a6be1b1f896fbdfe1d44b3a95518a180d8d2450206",
      "text": "收到了很多观众反馈，说很想知道\n圭先生平时都是怎么挑私服的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3eeb8e794c4132cf4377ce986ab5b3923264958591ccf0aed6f219ab5fc319cf",
      "text": "于是对方询问说，下次务必希望能从\n挑选衣服的过程开始拍摄呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_e:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8631eee65db097d99561cfb7a8f5e548f2a427e49ae4227bb15a3e51271184cf",
      "text": "这样啊。真伤脑筋呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_e:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad469e298f39bd28fd3610ed3d6d045fa313968b90ae9067e38cbb4bdf6d6283",
      "text": "怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_e:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd1f4240bd8dcd54995041d4cc1765f17f6e951dce4da4796dc09f33dfc97e0a",
      "text": "因为，说是要从挑选衣服开始拍吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_e:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de518fca3cb966559fe8c7512ed503e728b42ce539fc3a01a409ff85e0760cba",
      "text": "那样的话，就不能像上次那样\n让制作人帮忙了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_e:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:943209c6677d74332863a10b875f5ed78d659ba0d257e6a0d9655375cab6d8bf",
      "text": "不知道能不能像这次这样顺利呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_e:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80097e40d5e2f16b7516e2c404f3bd899097e4b047b75747a23bb8557d8a227b",
      "text": "只要像今天早上那样挑选就没问题了哦。\n那套衣服穿在圭先生身上也格外合适！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_01_1_2_007_01:1_2_007_01_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25e0e96181b14aafbd90bd9f876304ceb0bf662a473ac4bbe72660f85cb8ef43",
      "text": "……这样啊，谢谢你。\n既然你都这么说了，那我就试着做做看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
